# Mobile-First UI

- Write base styles for mobile (360px+), then add `sm:` `md:` `lg:` breakpoints
- Primary CTAs in thumb zone (lower half of screen on mobile)
- Minimum touch target: 48px height, 8px gap between tappable elements
- No `Table` on mobile — use stacked cards
- Container: `max-w-md` mobile, `max-w-5xl` on `lg+`
- Bottom nav on mobile, sidebar on `lg+`
- Contrast ratio ≥ 4.5:1 for text
- Status indicators: color + icon + text (never color alone)
- Use `tabular-nums` for numeric displays
